            <div className="hidden print:block text-center pt-10 border-t border-slate-100 text-[9px] text-slate-400 uppercase font-bold">
              Disclaimer: This report is generated by MedScan AI based on optical character recognition. Always verify medical decisions with a qualified healthcare professional. MedScan is not liable for dosage errors.
